    ],
    "bannedTermsNote": "2.0.0 adds 'Microsoft', 'Vista Air', 'Workday', 'OneDrive' and 'LinkedIn': real product/company names that were present in the clone's own copy until commit 1b3b419 replaced them (IntegrationsVisual, TestimonialQuote autotabs preset, CsPlatformBody integration tags, WebinarsUpcoming). They stay banned so a generator cannot reintroduce them.",
